  "title": "Tooth Fairy: what it is, and how it got there",
  "verdict": "Tooth Fairy now sees the whole shank's CSD through both 10-40 Hz and 5-100 Hz. On the 32 recordings step 4 -- the blend on even channels -- could also be tested on, it leaves a person a third fewer candidates to look at at the 20% setting (10.2% flagged against 15.7%: 1,026 candidates instead of 1,580) and cleans more of the garbage out automatically (91.5% against 87.5%). The cost is a little more garbage let into DS there, 1.7% against 1.3%."
